        "skill-section-5ae19b293c1191b76e71c9cceb946815",
        "skill-section-2fba164cb9e1d494b798eb086fc185da",
        "skill-section-0778418b67b70505a0cb8656e6e156c8"
      ],
      "text": "When a system matters, propose specific costs, limits, consequences, and social impact without creating Canon."
